# Only serving/build inputs may enter the context. Everything else is excluded.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!src/**

# Defense in depth, including sensitive files accidentally placed under src/.
**/.dvc/
**/.aws/
**/.git/
**/.ssh/
**/.gnupg/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.kube/
